[{"type":"message","user":"U0236LUF2TB","text":"\u003c@U0236LUF2TB\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1622108478.333700","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"405aed18-ffc9-4f33-81aa-97e41cd4cf75","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"プロ野球のピッチャーが交代したらすぐにアイシングでケアしてるあれですな。","ts":"1622076680.333500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EPJz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06d79a31-5724-42b5-9079-94b57a7175e6","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ちょっとまえにはてブに上ってた気がする","ts":"1622076394.333000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4M/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"64FA65BC-15A9-4763-BABA-BE853BD47F91","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"そうそう。炎症なので、火傷と同じでまずは冷やすがいいですね。","ts":"1622075677.332700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vf0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dbf0c650-34e2-46f9-b3c0-18548b602209","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あとは、ビタミンBを取るとすぐ治るらしい","ts":"1622075425.331600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SsS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"915efa3e-b935-47af-a851-3818842c44da","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"筋トレ直後に温めると、炎症が悪化する場合があるから、一度冷やして抑えてから温める\nが一番良いらしい","ts":"1622075415.331200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pa/kf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28dfb712-4f4d-4536-bd13-ba3f5c9e56f6","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"冷やして炎症を抑えたあとに、温めて血流を良くすると早く治るらしい","ts":"1622075374.330500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d0A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7f162a00-c0f2-4665-a04c-b46dabc2b976","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"筋肉の回復は、トレーニングしたあとに一度冷やすと良いらしいです","ts":"1622075355.330000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EkUm/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ae2bf93-3c70-4430-8c39-a2f01de7be87","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ストレッチは必ずやっていますね","ts":"1622075333.329400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dzr2S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"F2E52083-796C-4C77-97E4-B4A9377B1AAB","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"筋トレ目的であれば、きつくないトレーニングをしても筋肉増えないから、効果としては運動した気分が味わえるくらいかな。\nそれよりも軽くストレッチして風呂入って寝る方が早く治ると思います。筋肉痛疲労回復には、熱めの風呂を短めに入るのがいいらしいですよ。","ts":"1622074396.329100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uvyb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66570bc0-3c3d-4fda-b421-13df12be0bfb","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"積極的休息的なものかしらん……？","ts":"1622074300.326700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h+e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"923d1139-0aba-47b8-854a-55d7a1e79856","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"トレーニングで良くなるではなく、良くなる流れでストレッチなど負担なく回復を多少補助できる、くらいだろうけど...\nなんにせよ良かったですね","ts":"1622073776.324600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DCl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eecb2afd-5921-4a7a-bad9-fdb9fda66694","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"意外","ts":"1622073506.323500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B1t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7d0f3a8-6ad0-4232-9d68-e92aec1b506b","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"昨日トレーニングしたところ、筋肉痛が更に良くなってきている","ts":"1622073499.323200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7HtN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e4f1a6b4-152d-4343-9632-fe2b0110db42","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"筋肉痛完全にとりきっていない状態で、昨日ジム行ってきたんだけど筋肉痛がよくなっている\nどうやら、ちょっと筋肉痛が残っても、きつくないトレーニングはやっても問題なさそう","ts":"1622073468.322700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"im8O+"}]}]
